The '''Sukatic languages''' are [[MAIN LANG FAMILY languages]] spoken primarily by the [[Sukatic peoples]] and their descendants. They all directly descent from the [[Sukat language]], spoken by the [[Sukats]]. 

The Sukatic languages are divided into four geographic groups: [[North Sukatic languages|North]], [[South Sukatic languages|South]], [[East Sukatic languages|East]], and [[West Sukatic languages|West]]. Together, they comprise around NUM languages. 

